9\">\n      Techgaming.nl\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Best in class for price/performance </p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      For the price, the B550-F Gaming (Wi-Fi) is an attractive motherboard with many conceivable features.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>10/12/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-F GAMING (WI-FI) Media review Award of Best in class for price/performance \" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://techgaming.nl/review-asus-rog-strix-b550-f-gaming-wi-fi/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001092255220720856.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Techtesters.eu\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS offers a good balance in features, without real outliers in both a positive and negative way, and above all a more than sufficient VRM design.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>06/16/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-F GAMING (WI-FI) Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techtesters.eu/asus-rog-strix-b550-f-gaming-wifi-review/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1312/202001102126564770077.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Guru3d\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      ASUS has a nice offering with some pretty sweet features here...\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>NETHERLANDS</span> <span>06/16/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-F GAMING (WI-FI) Media review Award of Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.guru3d.com/articles-pages/asus-strix-b550-f-gaming-review,1.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1275/202012160212211040772.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Digit Zero1 Winner\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Digit\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Digit Zero1 Winner</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      For starters, this is the only board we’ve received which has an AX200 CNVi Wi-Fi module. The rest are all Wi-Fi 5 or 802.11ac, if they do have Wi-Fi. For the LAN port it has a 2.5GbE Intel I225-V NIC which is better than the Realtek solutions we tend to see on the other boards. The board uses an 8-Pin and 4-Pin EPS connector for the CPU power which feeds into an ASUS ASP1106 VRM controller. It implements a 12+2 phase design even though the ASP1106 is only capable of 4+2 mode. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>INDIA</span> <span>12/01/2020</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B550-F GAMING (WI-FI) Media review Award of Digit Zero1 Winner\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.digit.in/features/pc-components/digit-zero-1-awards-2020-best-b550-motherboard-57652.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.c